  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Consolidating the Reintegration Achievements of Senegalese Returned Migrants through Integrated Support to Micro and Small Enterprises (Phase II)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims at increasing economic opportunities for 20 returned migrants and 200 youth in the Kolda region of Senegal, including those living in rural and semi-urban areas, to boost youth employability, including through the support of the diaspora.</narrative>
  </description>
